{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/465677?v=4","date":"2015-05-08T19:25:17Z","email":"dravorek@gmail.com","login":"Bigpet","name":"Peter Tissen"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/465677?v=4","date":"2015-05-08T19:25:17Z","email":"dravorek@gmail.com","login":"Bigpet","name":"Peter Tissen"},"msg":"Update WxWidgets repository\n\nThis is in preparation to make it easy to compile with VS2015.\n\nAlso there's notables changes in wxWidgets that we might find very useful,\nsuch as being able to create OpenGL debug contexts.\n\nThe change in .gitmodules might make it necessary for people to run\n\"git submodule sync\" after pulling these changes","sha":"fe1b0e70b96609dd1a2059f227b22f65a04482dc"}
