{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2017-11-06T21:34:06Z","email":"karokidii@gmail.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2017-11-08T10:15:34Z","email":"karokidii@gmail.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"msg":"rsx: Minor fixups\n- Fix texture cache blit behaviour when src has AA enabled and dst is a blit dst texture with or without AA\n-- This requires handling AA resolve by removing a half downscale on multisampled axes\n\n- Return all ones when a vertex attribute is disabled.\n-- Some games forget to enable vertex attributes actually needed by the fs","sha":"ed21bb309f65eaa3bd072c3fe0ac656b3d544c83"}
