{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2018-06-12T15:46:59Z","email":"karokidii@gmail.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2018-06-18T14:32:22Z","email":"15904127+kd-11@users.noreply.github.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"msg":"vk: Add synchronous compute pipelines\n- Compute is now used to assist in some parts of blit operations, since there are no format conversions with vulkan like OGL does\n- TODO: Integrate this into all types of GPU memory conversion operations instead of downloading to CPU then converting","sha":"2afcf369ec64b93c5cefae38fc3f6891a9125c18"}
