{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2018-10-01T20:05:51Z","email":"karokidii@gmail.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2018-11-30T20:51:25Z","email":"15904127+kd-11@users.noreply.github.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"msg":"rsx: Fixups\n\n- Also fix visual corruption when using disjoint indexed draws\n\n- Refactor draw call emit again (vk)\n\n- Improve execution barrier resolve\n  - Allow vertex/index rebase inside begin/end pair\n  - Add ALPHA_TEST to list of excluded methods [TODO: defer raster state]\n\n- gl bringup\n\n- Simplify\n  - using the simple_array gets back a few more fps :)","sha":"677b16f5c68fbb2332bfa9f0ec2e746ebf49022e"}
