{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2019-04-06T17:29:58Z","email":"karokidii@gmail.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2019-04-09T10:40:54Z","email":"15904127+kd-11@users.noreply.github.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"msg":"vk: Dynamic heap management to potentially fix ring buffer overflows\n- Allows checking one heap type at a time, on demand\n- Should avoid OOM situations unless inside an uninterruptible block","sha":"12dc3c18723788024fd62a8dd6dd0f24d830d479"}
