{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1016937?v=4","date":"2018-09-28T22:12:00Z","email":"lassi.m.hamalainen@gmail.com","login":"kukkamario","name":"Lassi Hämäläinen"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2019-06-25T14:11:10Z","email":"Nekotekina@users.noreply.github.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Ivan"},"msg":"Remove unnecessary header includes\n\n- Manually removed lot of unneeded #includes to clean code and reduce\n  compilation time\n- Reordered some of the #includes to be in more logical order","sha":"c963c51a6071746255d71b9521e06591914d3f90"}
