{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2019-06-18T21:26:25Z","email":"karokidii@gmail.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2019-06-25T17:50:54Z","email":"15904127+kd-11@users.noreply.github.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"msg":"vk: Optimize occlusion pool management\n- Do not consume a slot every draw call, instead batch as many draws as possible\n- Since renderpasses are dispatched per-draw-clause, keeping occlusion queries outside the renderpasses works fine\n- If renderpasses are reorganized, occlusion tasks will have to be reorganized again","sha":"8249d51aa8ab58eddd914b3d3aedc62de34f159f"}
