{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7755816?v=4","date":"2019-10-22T21:59:09Z","email":"linkmauve@linkmauve.fr","login":"linkmauve","name":"Emmanuel Gil Peyrot"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2019-10-24T11:16:29Z","email":"Nekotekina@users.noreply.github.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Ivan"},"msg":"Audio: don’t build XAudio2 backend on Linux\n\nThe files already had a #ifdef _WIN32, but this avoid even trying to\ncompile their translation unit.\n\nI was surprised to see XAudio2 being mentioned on Linux, this makes sure\nno one else will get this surprise.","sha":"9253f7d645c891cb57a8785bdaeb93d02a80f307"}
