{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2019-11-10T08:27:22Z","email":"karokidii@gmail.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15904127?v=4","date":"2019-11-10T14:53:12Z","email":"15904127+kd-11@users.noreply.github.com","login":"kd-11","name":"kd-11"},"msg":"vk: Initialize queries before use\n\n- The spec does not guarantee that queries are initialized. In fact, it\nnow says all queries must be reset before they are used for the first\ntime.","sha":"5968427a2fb5ef4c2eeeca7058d16377ea07fa13"}
