{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18193363?v=4","date":"2020-01-29T20:42:41Z","email":"elad3356p@gmail.com","login":"elad335","name":"Eladash"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","date":"2020-01-29T20:42:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","login":"web-flow","name":"GitHub"},"msg":"Increase Maximum Vblank Rate and Clocks Scale\n\nAllow x30 times the speed of vblank rate + clocks scale of original PS3.\r\nIn theory a 60 fps limit game which scales frame limit perfectly with vblank rate can be played at up to 1800 fps with this change.\r\n\r\nAnd:\r\n* Fixed lv2 sleep with Clocks Scaling\r\n* Make these settings dynamicaly adjustable.\r\n* Avoid code duplication","sha":"92466165f60ea894253d9d6b7be834d84f496c78"}
