{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019877?v=4","date":"2020-09-12T12:52:54Z","email":"studienricky89@googlemail.com","login":"Megamouse","name":"Megamouse"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019877?v=4","date":"2020-09-16T22:39:41Z","email":"studienricky89@googlemail.com","login":"Megamouse","name":"Megamouse"},"msg":"Look for rap file for network license\n\nA network license should be the same as a local license, with the difference that a local license is only checked online once, while a network license is checked online on each boot.\nSince we don't check online anyway, the two should theoretically be identical for our purposes.","sha":"6540393df51769c953a09fe0d99d2ad62264bfde"}
