{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2020-10-30T02:17:00Z","email":"nekotekina@gmail.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Nekotekina"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2020-10-30T02:22:09Z","email":"nekotekina@gmail.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Nekotekina"},"msg":"CPU: improve cpu_thread::suspend_all for cache efficiency (TSX)\n\nAdd prefetch hint list parameter.\nWorkloads may be executed by another thread on another CPU core.\nIt means they may benefit from directly prefetching the data as hinted.\nAlso implement mov_rdata_nt, for \"streaming\" data from such workloads.","sha":"0da24f21d65f3a6a1bd8e92cc0c2d27d3432bb04"}
