{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2020-11-04T11:56:40Z","email":"nekotekina@gmail.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Nekotekina"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2020-11-04T11:59:26Z","email":"nekotekina@gmail.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Nekotekina"},"msg":"Improve low-level mmap utilities (Linux/BSD)\n\nAdd madvise (MADV_WILLNEED) on utils::memory_commit\nAdd madvise (MADV_FREE or MADV_DONTNEED) on utils::memory_decommit\nImprove shm_open pseudo-random name (not used on Linux)","sha":"b66628baca83b1b2a552c45f8b8950303fb6ef04"}
{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2020-11-04T14:19:35Z","email":"nekotekina@gmail.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Nekotekina"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2020-11-05T02:51:43Z","email":"nekotekina@gmail.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Nekotekina"},"msg":"atomic.cpp: improvements.\n\nReduced static memory amount for waitable atomics.\nAllow notifier to skip notifications if wait/notify masks don't overlap.\nImprove raw_notify to wake up the thread by its id, add thread_id arg.\nAdd optional mask argument to notify_one() and notify_all().","sha":"5248240e104bc2be76ca23e680d7aa24dda0da31"}
