{"author":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2020-11-14T10:47:18Z","email":"nekotekina@gmail.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Nekotekina"},"committer":{"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6028184?v=4","date":"2020-11-14T10:56:23Z","email":"nekotekina@gmail.com","login":"Nekotekina","name":"Nekotekina"},"msg":"atomic.cpp: fix rare overload scenario\n\nIf slot allocation fails, increase reference counter in every slot.\nThis prevents search routine from \"losing\" some slots.","sha":"00f877e812ccb7a3fc87f9d3fe117279fa7db7f3"}
